{"title":"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8c372f5bd66530e9318dd224f3e3924c38c58dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x) = x^3+ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"197\" height=\"19\" /> has the property that the average of its zeros, the product of its zeros, and the sum of its coefficients are all equal. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept of the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/1/3d1db541df4771c9ef32bf4a78b920414c112e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> is 2. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/927e37758ca129c2b3edba57127f03cc8e199318.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mathrm{A})\\ -11 \\qquad (\\mathrm{B})\\ -10 \\qquad (\\mathrm{C})\\ -9 \\qquad (\\mathrm{D})\\ 1 \\qquad (\\mathrm{E})\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"427\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f72da4187cb0ff8d0471bef17474df62fe69c94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. So the product of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/4/15402bb0fcec202e8b781e12e715a26d1a4a6d8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-c = -2$\" width=\"69\" height=\"12\" /> by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a>. These also tell us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/4/5e406b1faf72378eee2bf8985e01b051ee3102c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-a}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"26\" height=\"33\" /> is the average of the zeros, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/4/dc471af1b47c6d386644002201699de1275fe6f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-a}3=-2 \\implies a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"167\" height=\"33\" />. We are also given that the sum of the coefficients is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed00fde07ec1eabfc26ff8e45b394cc13e5c1f22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+6+b+2 = -2 \\implies b=-11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"262\" height=\"14\" />. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/czk6OsfrbxQ?t=678\">https://youtu.be/czk6OsfrbxQ?t=678</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qtlXAxj4y2Y\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qtlXAxj4y2Y</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12\" title=\"2001 AMC 12\">2001 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"20